SWEET framebuffer cache invalidate (patch 0123, boot-arg sweetfb_inv=1, default off): clean+invalidate each presented layer source range before the panel copy, in case GPU-written surface data is hidden by stale CPU cache lines (gputest37: FB content hash constant while the GPU renders).
--- a/iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetFramebuffer.cpp
+++ b/iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetFramebuffer.cpp
@@ -369,6 +369,7 @@
 }
 
